     writable field was seized as ink and preventDefaulted, and every focus
     set inputmode none - so the keyboard never rose and the caret was never
     hers. She could neither write (the reading is not there yet) nor type
     (the keyboard was taken). The rules are now:
       - a TOUCH writes ONLY into a field she has switched to the pen, with
         the chip that sits beside the field; everywhere else it taps,
         scrolls and types exactly as the device intends;
       - a real PEN still writes anywhere, but ink begins only once the pen
